      "s": "Bloomberg Tech",
      "t": "Tesla's Future Is Robotaxis, Says Ark's Keeney",
      "d": "Tasha Keeney, Ark Investment director of investment analysis, says robotaxis are the future for Tesla. She says the company is well positioned over its peers and the Cybercab is cheaper to operate compared to Waymo's next generation vehicle. Elon Musk's company reported third-quarter profits that beat estimates. (Source: Bloomberg)",
      "u": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-21/tesla-s-future-is-robotaxis-says-ark-s-keeney-video",
      "m": "10. 21. PM 08:51",
